│  Count requests in the last N seconds.            │
│                                                  │
│  Rules:                                          │
│  • Window: 60 seconds                            │
│  • Max: 5 requests per window                    │
│                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  Timeline (60-second window):               │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  12:00:00  Request 1  ✅ (1 in window)     │ │
│  │  12:00:15  Request 2  ✅ (2 in window)     │ │
│  │  12:00:30  Request 3  ✅ (3 in window)     │ │
│  │  12:00:40  Request 4  ✅ (4 in window)     │ │
│  │  12:00:50  Request 5  ✅ (5 in window)     │ │
│  │  12:00:55  Request 6  ❌ DENIED (5 in win) │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  12:01:01  Request 1 expires (from 12:00:00)│ │
│  │            Now 4 in window                  │ │
│  │            Request 7  ✅ (5 in window)      │ │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                                  │
│  PROS: Most accurate — exact count at any moment │
│  CONS: Memory heavy (stores every timestamp)     │
