### Algorithm 4: Sliding Window Counter

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│        SLIDING WINDOW COUNTER                     │
│                                                  │
│  Fixes the edge problem of Fixed Window.          │
│  Uses weighted average of current + previous.     │
│                                                  │
│  Rules:                                          │
│  • Window: 1 minute                              │
│  • Max: 100 requests per window                  │
│                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  Previous window (12:00-12:01): 84 requests │ │
│  │  Current window  (12:01-12:02): 36 requests │ │
│  │  Current time: 12:01:15                     │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  Position in current window:                │ │
│  │  15 seconds / 60 seconds = 25% (0.25)       │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  Weighted count:                            │ │
│  │  = previousCount × (1 - position) +         │ │
│  │    currentCount                              │ │
│  │  = 84 × (1 - 0.25) + 36                    │ │
│  │  = 84 × 0.75 + 36                          │ │
│  │  = 63 + 36                                  │ │
│  │  = 99                                       │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  99 < 100 → ✅ ALLOWED                      │ │
│  │                                             │ │
│  │  Next request:                              │ │
│  │  = 63 + 37 = 100 → ❌ DENIED                │ │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                                  │
│  PROS: Best balance of accuracy + efficiency     │
│  CONS: Slightly approximate (not exact)          │
│                                                  │
│  Redis Data: Two Strings                         │
│  Key1: "rl:sw:{tenant}:{endpoint}:{currentWin}"  │
│  Key2: "rl:sw:{tenant}:{endpoint}:{previousWin}" │
│  Value: counter (integer)                        │
│                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

